+## Threshold Support
+- `generateReport` accepts optional `thresholds` parameter (`{ exact_match: 0.9 }`).
+- Reports include `passed` (boolean) and `thresholds` (array of results) when thresholds are specified.
+- CLI `--threshold <metric>=<min>` validates metric IDs and min values (0 to 1), exits code 2 on error.
+- Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass or no thresholds specified.
